WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Can you unbake a cake?

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.910
No.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.520
Heat made new substances from the egg and flour.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.040
That's an irreversible change.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.016
Burning and rusting are the same kind.
